OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Reform Wales leader Dan Thomas
OL,4,Afaces no further police action after
OL,5,Aassault arrest
OL,6,
OL,7,FReform's former leader in Wales faces
OL,8,Fno further action from Gwent Police
OL,9,Ffollowing his arrest in September, the
OL,10,Fforce has said.
OL,12,FDan Thomas resigned from his role
OL,13,Fleading the largest opposition party in
OL,14,Fthe Senedd after the arrest, triggering
OL,15,Fa leadership contest that led to the
OL,16,Felection of Helen Jenner.
OL,18,FThe force at the time said a
OL,19,F45-year-old man from Aberbargoed,
OL,20,FCaerphilly, had been arrested on
OL,21,Fsuspicion of assault and controlling or
OL,22,Fcoercive behaviour.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
