OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Reform Wales leader Dan Thomas
OL,4,Afaces no further police action after
OL,5,Aassault arrest
OL,6,
OL,7,FThomas said he had been "vindicated"
OL,8,Fand thanked Reform leader Nigel Farage
OL,9,Ffor standing by him.
